  "terms_title": "Terms of Use",
  "terms_intro": "By using Qurb you agree to these terms. Qurb is an anonymous, location-based chat service — following these rules is required to keep your account active.",
  "terms_section_acceptance_h": "1. Acceptance",
  "terms_section_acceptance_b": "By completing the welcome screen you confirm that you are 13 years of age or older, that you have read the Privacy Policy and Community Guidelines, and that you agree to be bound by them. If you do not agree, close the app and do not use it.",
  "terms_section_anonymity_h": "2. Anonymous identity",
  "terms_section_anonymity_b": "We do not ask for your name, email, or phone number. Your account is tied to this device only — if you lose or wipe it, you may not be able to recover access. Do not impersonate other users or claim to represent an official entity.",
  "terms_section_content_h": "3. Your content",
  "terms_section_content_b": "You are solely responsible for what you post. Your posts are shown to users geographically near you. Do not upload content owned by others without permission. You grant us a non-exclusive license to display what you post inside the app, solely to operate the service.",
  "terms_section_conduct_h": "4. Prohibited conduct",
  "terms_section_conduct_b": "Forbidden: profanity, threats, harassment, hate speech, sharing other people's private information (doxxing), explicit sexual content, advertising and fraud, impersonation, and any illegal activity. Violations result in content removal or account ban.",
  "terms_section_termination_h": "5. Termination",
  "terms_section_termination_b": "We may suspend or delete your account if you violate these terms. You may delete your account at any time from Settings › Delete Account — this permanently removes your posts, comments, and chats.",
  "terms_section_disclaimer_h": "6. Disclaimer",
  "terms_section_disclaimer_b": "The service is provided \"as is\" without warranty. We are not responsible for content posted by other users. Reliance on any information you see in the app is at your own risk.",
  "terms_section_contact_h": "7. Contact",
  "terms_section_contact_b": "Questions or to report a violation: Settings › Report a problem.",

  "privacy_title": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacy_intro": "Qurb is built around one promise: your identity stays anonymous.",
  "privacy_section_identity_h": "1. Your identity",
  "privacy_section_identity_b": "When you sign up we generate a 5-digit numeric ID. We never ask for your name, photo, email, or phone number. The ID is the only thing other users see.",
  "privacy_section_location_h": "2. Location",
  "privacy_section_location_b": "If you grant location permission, your device's coordinates are snapped to a 100 m grid before they leave the device. We never store or transmit precise GPS. Other users only see relative distance buckets (near / neighborhood / city) — never raw coordinates.",
  "privacy_section_content_h": "3. Your content",
  "privacy_section_content_b": "Posts and comments are public to nearby users. Whispers are end-to-end private between two participants. You can delete your account at any time from Settings — this removes all your posts, comments, and conversations.",
  "privacy_section_moderation_h": "4. Moderation",
  "privacy_section_moderation_b": "We run automated checks on submitted text for profanity, scam patterns, and disallowed links. Content reported by 3+ users in 24 hours is auto-hidden pending review.",
  "privacy_section_contact_h": "5. Contact",
  "privacy_section_contact_b": "Questions? Use \"Report a problem\" in Settings.",

